*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
TITLE
2.45 MeV neutron point source in air irradiating a water cube
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO
BEAM       -2.45E-03                                                  NEUTRON
BEAM       -2.45E-03                                                  NEUTRON
*
GEOBEGIN           0         0                                        COMBNAME
    0    0          Water cube in air with outer blackhole boundary
RPP bndbox     -1000.0 +1000.0 -1000.0 +1000.0 -1000.0 +1000.0
RPP airbox     -50.0 +50.0 -50.0 +50.0 -50.0 +50.0
RPP watbox     -5.0 +5.0 -5.0 +5.0 -5.0 +5.0
END
* outer blackhole shell
regBH        5 +bndbox -airbox
* air surrounding the phantom
regAIR       5 +airbox -watbox
* water phantom cube
regWAT       5 +watbox
END
GEOEND
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE     regBH
ASSIGNMA         AIR    regAIR
ASSIGNMA       WATER    regWAT
* neutron fluence spectrum in water (track-length estimator)
USRTRACK        -1.0   NEUTRON     -31.0    regWAT    1000.0      80.0NFWAT
USRTRACK       0.020      1E-9                                         &
* one-way neutron boundary fluence from air to water over cube surface
USRBDX          99.0   NEUTRON     -32.0    regAIR    regWAT     600.0NBDXAW
USRBDX         0.020      1E-9      80.0                               &
* cartesian mesh: deposited energy in and around the cube
USRBIN          10.0    ENERGY     -33.0      15.0      15.0      25.0EDEPWAT
USRBIN         -15.0     -15.0     -25.0      30.0      30.0      50.0 &
* cartesian mesh: dose in and around the cube
USRBIN          10.0      DOSE     -34.0      15.0      15.0      25.0DOSEWAT
USRBIN         -15.0     -15.0     -25.0      30.0      30.0      50.0 &
RANDOMIZ         1.0 987654321
START      5000000.0
STOP
